<subsection xml:id="sec-14-honors-projects-and-research-summer">
  <title>Honors Projects &amp; Research</title>

  <p>
    Summer sessions have a shorter timeline, but research participation and honors project
    planning are still available in many cases.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you are interested in research or honors work, contact the instructor early so we can
    determine feasibility, scope, and deliverables for the session length.
  </p>
</subsection>
